     "reciprocal",
     "numerator",
     "product"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "To multiply fractions multiply the numerators and the denominators. Half of 3/4 is 1/2 times 3/4, which is 3/8.\nTo divide by a fraction multiply by its reciprocal. 2 divided by 1/4 is 2 times 4, which is 8.\nThe reciprocal of 3/5 is 5/3."
    }
